No DNS lookups of the text under the pointer (CVE-2015-9231).

Backported from upstream 33ccaf61e3 (3.1.1), "Fist swipe at removing DNS
code", with e4eb106352, adapted to 3.0.15. With Command held, the host
of a URL under the pointer was resolved over DNS to decide how to
underline it. That sent whatever text was there, passwords included, to
the network in clear. AsyncHostLookupController is deleted, along with
every use of it, the drawing helper's haveUnderlinedHostname, and the
performDNSLookups setting. A URL under the pointer is now always drawn
as a link.

